single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/format.ts, src/commands.test.ts, src/format.test.ts, src/storage.test.ts, src/types.test.ts  (Renamed Todo.done to Todo.completed in types.ts and updated every place that reads or writes it (commands.ts add/complete/list, format.ts formatTodo) plus the test fixtures. Not changed: ListOptions.includeDone, since the request names only the Todo field. Note: storage.load casts the JSON unchecked, so todo files written before this change still have \"done\" and will load as not completed. No migration added since the request didn't ask for one.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (The oracle is green (tsc clean, 10/10 tests pass) and Todo.done is now Todo.completed in every caller and fixture.)

